# Capture the TP's commanded path velocity every servo cycle.
#
# motion.current-vel is written in output_to_hal, so filestream.read has to run
# after motion-controller in the same thread -- appended after core_sim.hal, it
# does. The whole point of sampling here rather than polling from a script is
# that a deceleration ramp is tens of milliseconds long: anything slower than
# the servo rate cannot see its shape at all.
load filestream sample_cfg=f outfile=vel.txt depth=32768 samples=0
net tp-vel <= motion.current-vel => filestream.sample.0
addf filestream.read servo-thread
